fugo began as a fork of Hugo (https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo), named neohugo. Versions
0.148.2 and earlier were Hugo's Go code with neohugo's changes; fugo 1.0.0 and later are a
rewrite in Rust that includes material derived from Hugo: templates rewritten from Hugo's
embedded templates (Go templates to Tera), Hugo's LiveReload plugin, behaviour transcribed from
Hugo's Go sources, and Hugo's test data and documentation used as test fixtures. PROVENANCE.md
lists each such file, its source and how it was changed.

